{
    "title": "Idle Cinema Empire Idle Games",
    "description": "Ready to get started managing your own cinema? Let's become a cinema tycoon together!\r\n\r\nExpand the space in front of the cinema, upgrade the service facilities, get more movies and manage the movie schedule.\r\n\r\nAttract more customers, give them the best movie experience, unlock more auditoriums, and play the coolest movies!\r\n\r\nBuild a variety of service facilities, such as Peripheral Shop, Game Hall, Ballroom and so on, to provide customers with a variety of services so that the waiting time is no longer boring and you can make extra profit.\r\n\r\nTo maximise ticket sales and profits, open a variety of auditoriums and arrange the most suitable type of film.\r\n\r\nHire an Offline Manager to keep your cinema running while you're gone and reap the profits.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- Easy and casual gameplay for any player\r\n- Real-time gameplay with idle mechanics\r\n- Constant challenges suitable for any player at any level\r\n- Many exciting quests to complete\r\n- Collect hundreds of films to become a movie tycoon\r\n- Unique items to upgrade your cinema facilities\r\n- Amazing 3D graphics and animations\r\n- Offline play, no internet connection required",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ready to get started managing your own cinema? Let&#39;s become a cinema tycoon together!<br><br>Expand the space in front of the cinema, upgrade the service facilities, get more movies and manage the movie schedule.<br><br>Attract more customers, give them the best movie experience, unlock more auditoriums, and play the coolest movies!<br><br>Build a variety of service facilities, such as Peripheral Shop, Game Hall, Ballroom and so on, to provide customers with a variety of services so that the waiting time is no longer boring and you can make extra profit.<br><br>To maximise ticket sales and profits, open a variety of auditoriums and arrange the most suitable type of film.<br><br>Hire an Offline Manager to keep your cinema running while you&#39;re gone and reap the profits.<br><br>Features:<br><br>- Easy and casual gameplay for any player<br>- Real-time gameplay with idle mechanics<br>- Constant challenges suitable for any player at any level<br>- Many exciting quests to complete<br>- Collect hundreds of films to become a movie tycoon<br>- Unique items to upgrade your cinema facilities<br>- Amazing 3D graphics and animations<br>- Offline play, no internet connection required",
